LAMMPS (27 Oct 2021)
clear
units		metal
atom_style atomic
dimension	3
boundary	p p p

atom_modify 	map array

variable 	a0 	equal 	(1015/1000.0)*2.8665
variable	vol	equal	${a0}*${a0}*${a0}
variable	vol	equal	2.9094975*${a0}*${a0}
variable	vol	equal	2.9094975*2.9094975*${a0}
variable	vol	equal	2.9094975*2.9094975*2.9094975
variable 	n0 	equal  1
lattice 	bcc ${a0}
lattice 	bcc 2.9094975
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 2.9094975 2.9094975 2.9094975
region		box block 0.0 ${n0} 0.0 ${n0} 0.0 ${n0}
region		box block 0.0 1 0.0 ${n0} 0.0 ${n0}
region		box block 0.0 1 0.0 1 0.0 ${n0}
region		box block 0.0 1 0.0 1 0.0 1
create_box 	1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0.0000000 0.0000000 0.0000000) to (2.9094975 2.9094975 2.9094975)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms 	1 box
Created 2 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0.0000000 0.0000000 0.0000000) to (2.9094975 2.9094975 2.9094975)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds

mass		1 55.845

#Define Potential
pair_style 	hybrid/overlay eam/alloy
pair_coeff 	* * eam/alloy Fe_Mishin2006.eam.alloy Fe

neighbor     0.1 bin
neigh_modify     every 10 check yes delay 20


thermo_style custom etotal
thermo       1

variable        etotal0   equal etotal/(${n0}*${n0}*${n0})
variable        etotal0   equal etotal/(1*${n0}*${n0})
variable        etotal0   equal etotal/(1*1*${n0})
variable        etotal0   equal etotal/(1*1*1)
run	0
